From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dmitry Afonchenko <undermove1@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 03:39:33 +0400
Subject: [PATCH 54/60] Meridian: Switch to Tab in the command bar; panels
 close each other; the chat steps aside
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- ⌘T and New Tab list the open tabs (favorites, pinned, Today) under the
  field while nothing is typed, and the matching ones as you type; a click,
  or the arrows and Return, switch to it. The field keeps its hint, Search or
  Enter URL, while focused.
- The Site Control Center closes when another panel opens.
- Picking another tab leaves the Chat view.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SwxrQ2eLfJ2bv8cCoG2va1
